    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d508-a4">

                <pb facs="0635" n="527" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg527"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1892</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To whom it may concern:</hi></p>
                <p>This is to certify that Jacob Goldstein purchased of us on February 20, 1892, one
                    steerage ticket to Bremen per steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Spree</hi>,
                    sailing February 23, and on the same day paid us the amount for a United States
                    passport, which we procured for him from Washington and mailed to him <hi
                        rendition="#italic">poste restante</hi> Bremen.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. B. Richard</hi> &amp; Co.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
